abstract: "Every quantum-computing platform compared by the goal it serves; a technology graph of 96 self-contained technologies across ten stack layers, seven design coordinates and five edge types, with platforms as paths; a brief on each technology; every figure tagged and traced to a dated primary source. Bilingual EN/RU, published as one interactive document."
